closePort -- closes and open port
*********************************

Description
===========

When a port is opened with the *note openPort: openPort, method, closePort() is
used to close the port. If the user forgets to close the port, closing or
restarting Macaulay2 will automatically close the port.

+----------------------------------------------------------+
|i1 : closePort()                                          |
|--Port null is now closing. This could take a few seconds.|
+----------------------------------------------------------+

Caveat
======

This method does not have an input. In order for it to run, you must write the
'()' at the end as follows: closePort().

