VisPath -- an option to define a path to save visualizations
************************************************************

Description
===========

The default nature of the Visualize package is to open the visualization in a
temporary file. Use the VisPath option if you wish to save the visualization to
a given directory. If the process will overwrite files, a warning appears
asking the user if they would like to proceed. You can squelch this warning
with the *note Warning: Warning, option.

